  <div class="body-grid "><main><div class='section-heading knowledge-heading'><h2>Knowledge</h2><a class='primary add-note' href='/knowledge?mode=new' aria-label='Create a note'>＋ <span>New note</span></a></div><div class='tabs knowledge-tabs'><a href='/knowledge' aria-current='page'>Documents</a><a href='/knowledge?mode=graph'>Graph</a><a href='/knowledge?mode=review'>Review</a></div><div class='knowledge-workspace'><aside class='note-files' aria-label='Notes'><span class='eyebrow'>DOCUMENTS</span><a href='/knowledge?doc=scratchpad' aria-current='page'><span>▤</span> Scratchpad.md</a><a href='/knowledge?doc=plan'><span>▤</span> Plan</a></aside><section class='knowledge-content'><form class='note-editor' method='post' action='/knowledge/save'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='scratchpad'><input type='hidden' name='revision' value='0'><div class='note-toolbar'><label class='note-name'>Name<input name='title' required maxlength='80' value='Scratchpad.md' placeholder='Untitled.md'></label><button class='primary'>Save changes ↗</button></div><p class='note-status'>Draft · save to keep your changes</p><label class='note-body-label'>Markdown · connect notes with [[note name]]<textarea class='editor' name='body' maxlength='32000' rows='22' aria-label='Note text'>Notes link [[Plan]] &amp; &lt;more&gt;</textarea></label></form><div class='note-connections'><h3>Connections</h3><a href='/knowledge?doc=plan'>↗ Plan</a><a href='/knowledge?doc=plan'>↙ Linked from Plan</a></div></section></div><div class="bottom-note"><span>⌘ CONTROL</span></div></main></div>
